@startuml
title 适老化打车平台 - SOS紧急求助完整链路时序图 (SOS Emergency Sequence)

actor "老年用户" as User
participant "APP前端\n(React Native)" as App
participant "安全服务\n(SafetyService)" as Safety
participant "后端API\n(Backend API)" as API
participant "紧急服务\n(110/120)" as Emergency
participant "亲友端" as Family
participant "平台客服" as Platform

== 1. SOS触发（防误触） ==
User -> App: 按下SOS按钮
activate App
App -> App: 检测按压\n(非单击，需长按)
App -> App: 开始3秒倒计时\n+每秒振动反馈
App -> App: 大字显示倒计时\n"3...2...1..."

alt 用户松开(未到3秒)
  App -> App: 取消SOS
  App --> User: "已取消求助"
  deactivate App
  stop
else 倒计时结束(3秒到)
  App -> App: SOS确认触发
end

== 2. SOS调度 ==
App -> Safety: triggerSOS(orderId, location, callAmbulance)
activate Safety
Safety -> Safety: 检查网络状态

alt 网络不可用(离线SOS)
  Safety -> Safety: 离线缓存SOS请求\n(AsyncStorage)
  Safety -> Safety: 预载紧急短信\n(直接发送给亲友)
  Safety -> Family: 尝试发送紧急短信\n(短信可能独立于数据网络)
  Safety --> App: {dispatched: false, queued: true}
  App --> User: "求助已缓存，网络恢复后自动发送"
  deactivate Safety
  deactivate App
  stop
else 网络正常
  Safety -> API: POST /api/v1/safety/sos\n{orderId, location, callAmbulance}
  activate API
end

== 3. 紧急服务调度 ==
API -> API: 创建SOS事件记录\n(sos_events表)
API -> API: 获取行程信息\n(司机/车牌/路线)

alt 需要急救车
  API -> Emergency: 拨打120急救
  activate Emergency
  Emergency --> API: 120已受理
  deactivate Emergency
else 标准求助
  API -> Emergency: 拨打110报警
  activate Emergency
  Emergency --> API: 110已受理
  deactivate Emergency
end

== 4. 亲友通知 ==
API -> API: 查询紧急联系人列表
API -> Family: 推送SOS紧急通知\n"您的家人正在求助！"
activate Family
API -> Family: 发送实时位置链接\n+行程信息(司机/车牌)
Family --> API: 确认收到通知
deactivate Family

== 5. 平台介入 ==
API -> Platform: 推送SOS告警\n"订单{orderId}触发SOS"
activate Platform
Platform --> API: 客服已介入
deactivate Platform

== 6. 行程录音启动 ==
API -> Safety: 启动行程录音
Safety -> Safety: 开始录音\n(每30秒上传片段)
Safety -> Safety: 录音存储至S3\n(加密存储)

== 7. 响应确认 ==
API --> Safety: 返回SOS响应
deactivate API
Safety --> App: {sosId, dispatched, services, familyNotified, recordingStarted}
deactivate Safety

App -> App: 大字确认页\n"已为您呼叫帮助"
App -> App: TTS播报"已为您呼叫110/120，并通知家人"
App --> User: "已为您呼叫帮助\n110/120已出发\n家人已通知\n录音已开启"
deactivate App

== 8. 后续处理 ==
loop 每30秒
  Safety -> API: 上传录音片段
end

loop 每10秒
  App -> API: 上报实时位置
  API -> Family: 更新位置共享
end

== 9. SOS解除 ==
alt 用户确认安全
  User -> App: 点击"确认安全"
  activate App
  App -> API: POST /api/v1/safety/sos/{sosId}/cancel\n{resolution: "safe"}
  activate API
  API -> API: 更新SOS状态为已解除
  API -> API: 停止录音
  API -> Family: 推送"已确认安全"
  API -> Platform: 推送"SOS已解除"
  API --> App: SOS已解除
  deactivate API
  App --> User: "SOS已解除，祝您安全"
  deactivate App
else 误触发(3分钟内确认)
  User -> App: 点击"误触发"
  activate App
  App -> API: POST /api/v1/safety/sos/{sosId}/cancel\n{isFalseAlarm: true}
  activate API
  API -> API: 标记为误触发\n(记录日志)
  API -> API: 停止录音
  API -> Family: 推送"误触发已取消"
  API --> App: 已取消
  deactivate API
  App --> User: "已取消，如有需要请再次长按SOS"
  deactivate App
end

@enduml